                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fa416b5a-4937-323a-9a14-2fa0706a8d38",
                        "entry_id": "3b7b4445-01da-3298-839e-1623885d3153",
                        "glosses": [
                            "хим. химический элемент с атомным номером 32, обозначается химическим символом Ge, полуметалл"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "12c842b4-a166-4088-b671-a604f24d4003",
                                "sense_id": "fa416b5a-4937-323a-9a14-2fa0706a8d38",
                                "text": "Д. И. Менделеев, руководствуясь созданной им Периодической системой, предсказал существование и описал свойства 12 неизвестных элементов: галлия, скандия, германия, полония, астата, гафния, рения, технеция, франция, радия, актиния и протактиния."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f6da3e41-b60f-4394-9f06-74a73b314bc8",
                        "source_entry_id": "3b7b4445-01da-3298-839e-1623885d3153",
                        "source_sense_id": "fa416b5a-4937-323a-9a14-2fa0706a8d38",
                        "target_lang_word": "germanium",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "germanium",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6861a1cd-336f-304d-94d8-d73f8deaa4ea",
                                        "entry_id": "d62c2855-1d2d-3549-bb99-f71d77bea92f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A nonmetallic chemical element (symbol Ge) with an atomic number of 32: a lustrous, hard-brittle, grayish-white metalloid in the carbon group."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7852eed8-d99e-4a75-b87e-e97677809189",
                                                "sense_id": "6861a1cd-336f-304d-94d8-d73f8deaa4ea",
                                                "text": "This equipment, which includes transformers, germanium rectifiers and smoothing apparatus, has been designed to allow the existing electric multiple-unit traction motors to operate on rectified alternating current."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4228ef4c-d38e-4d6e-8738-2de578414219",
                                                "sense_id": "6861a1cd-336f-304d-94d8-d73f8deaa4ea",
                                                "text": "The isolated disordered regions and the amorphous layer have widely different anneal behavior. In the case of germanium and silicon, the isolated disordered regions anneal at moderate temperatures of approximately 200° and 300° C, respectively. The amorphous layers also anneal in a characteristic fashion, but at appreciably higher temperatures, i.e., at approximately 600° C in silicon and 400° C in germanium."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d6aa9a76-64df-3842-8294-7f13447c28dd",
                                        "entry_id": "d62c2855-1d2d-3549-bb99-f71d77bea92f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An atom of this element."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
